      "extract": "As illustrated in the ${\\cal O}(p^4)$ case \\cite{Ecker:1988te,Ecker:1989yg} a procedure to systematically disclose the structure of the resonance contributions to the LECs in $\\chi PT$ is available. The key point is to construct a Lagrangian theory that includes resonances, Goldstone bosons and auxiliary fields respecting the underlying chiral symmetry. There are several tools that allow us to grab important",
